world I've been to Miami Vice quote-unquote for a lot of my life because

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:09.650
if you're on a rock and roll tour it surrounds you you know day and night and

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:14.410
the first reason I got this place was just to be able to recuperate or or just

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:18.480
get away from it all because you know nobody can really survive that sort of

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:24.930
pace and and also basically it was it works like I had research for Miami Vice

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:29.280
through my life on rock and roll tours and now I can just sit back and draw on

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.000
on my memories.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:39.850
and it all comes back, and it all gets reflected in the music.

