00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.260
That's where we come in, with music.

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.220
He's my friend.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:55.650
It's a theme that pervades this show, of this real tension, where at first the music may

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:59.830
sound like everything is okay, but there's this rhythm guitar that's just pounding away,

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.000
really.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:05.850
relentlessly to show that something is really going wrong.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:13.730
But what's coming in this scene is, the next scene takes place in a church where the baptism,

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:16.290
where Scrockett is the godfather, takes place.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:24.670
So we go directly cross-fade from the intense troubled music into this very peaceful church

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:29.410
organ, which plays the same music, it's the same piece of music.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.340
And we stay in there for the scene where Crockett puts a cross on the child's forehead and the child's baptized.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:39.440
And then we go back and we see Crockett back at the police station washing his face with water.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.680
It's a very nice combination of cymbals.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:48.110
And we somehow get back into that real troubled music and then Rico comes in to have a talk.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:54.400
And the first idea I had for that piece was really just that guitar rhythm there.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:18:00.000
The real pounding, sort of consistent, intense feel.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:04.710
And everything else, all that peaceful stuff came later, especially when I saw the baptism scene.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.350
It just opened up the music line.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:11.720
I don't feel like a wizard.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:20.020
I feel more like I'm on the receiving end of something magical.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:25.150
And I've fortunately spent my life preparing for this.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.000
You know, getting all my tools ready, be it my mind, my fingers...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:37.950
