00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:42.800
enable me to do the most amazing sounds that no one's ever heard and come up with new sounds

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:50.380
that amaze me. It's not that I'm the wizard, okay? I think something magical is happening

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:56.830
elsewhere and I'm just tuned into it. I don't know what it is.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:00.000
Working with Don Johnson this last year has been a trip. I mean,

